  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;BIOPRINTING PROCESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Bioprinting Process is a 3D printing technique used to create functional living tissue and organs, involving the layer-by-layer deposition of biomaterials such as cells, proteins, and biomolecules. It has the potential to transform medicine through artificial organ creation and regenerative medicine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOPRINTING TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bioprinting Technology is a revolutionary 3D printing technique used to create functional living tissue and organs, involving the layer-by-layer deposition of biomaterials such as cells, proteins, and biomolecules."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOPRINTING ACT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Bioprinting Act is a legislative act that has been approved, symbolizing support for scientific progress and technological adaptation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUEEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Queen is a figurehead who approved the Bioprinting Act, symbolizing the monarchy's adaptability to emerging technologies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;_JOURNAL OF MODERN HISTORY_&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"_Journal of Modern History_ is a publication that discussed the Queen's approval of the Bioprinting Act, emphasizing its historical and political significance."&lt;SEP&gt;"_Journal of Modern History_ is a publication that discussed the Queen's approval of the Bioprinting Act, highlighting its historical and political significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2020 ARTICLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 2020 article in the _Journal of Modern History_ discussed the Queen's approval of the Bioprinting Act, highlighting its historical and political significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MODERN TECHNOLOGIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Modern technologies, such as bioprinting, are highlighted in the context of the Bioprinting Act and the Queen's approval."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCIENTIFIC PROGRESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Scientific progress is supported by the approval of the Bioprinting Act and the Queen's endorsement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MONARCHY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The monarchy is represented by the Queen and is shown to be adaptable to modern technologies and scientific progress."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HISTORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"History is intertwined with the approval of the Bioprinting Act and the role of the monarchy in supporting scientific progress."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLITICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Politics plays a role in the approval of the Bioprinting Act and the Queen's endorsement of modern technologies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES PATENT AND TRADEMARK OFFICE (USPTO)&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0069</data>
      <data key="d1">"US Patent 11517453 was granted by the USPTO, recognizing the bioprinting process as a valuable technology."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
